@startuml seq-04-pay-ask-first
!include style.iuml
title An agent's first payment to an unknown recipient asks; the owner's answer sets the rule\nrecipient: unknown → always | ask | deny; payment: Idle → Waiting → Queued | Refused | NotPaid (C3, C8, C9, C10, C11)
autonumber "<b>0."

participant "Agent Mara\n(model)" as Agent
participant "wallet~__send\n(EffectTool)" as Tool
database "Store" as Store
participant "Web app\n(chat card)" as Web
actor Owner
participant "Phone\n(paired device)" as Phone
participant "Wallet lane" as Lane

Agent -> Tool : wallet~__send {to: "0x9f3c…77a1", amount: "2", token: "USDC"}
Tool -> Store : admission commit
note right of Store
  No Deny, no Always for (Mara, wallet, 0x9f3c…): rule unknown,
  the wallet's default for unknown recipients is Ask.
  Fits the available balance; limits hold (one open ask per
  (wallet, agent, recipient, amount, asset), at most 5 per agent).
  Opens a Wait (the draft) with a 24 h deadline; reserves 2 USDC.
  row: payment Idle · call [... eff == 'ask' and fits] → Waiting
end note
Store --> Web : card: 2 USDC (value in the owner's currency, as of now),\n0x9f3c…77a1 on Base Sepolia, wallet and balance after,\nMara's reason; Pay · Always pay · Don't pay · Never pay; name field
Tool --> Agent : "Asked the owner to approve paying 0x9f3c…77a1"

Owner -> Web : names it "Ana", taps "Always pay Ana, up to what's in the wallet"
Web -> Store : answer {wait, approve, scope always, label "Ana", version v}
note right of Store
  fill commit, first answer wins (C9):
  - Always permission {agent Mara, account, chain, to: 0x9f3c…}, scope always, no amount
  - recipient label "Ana" (the identity is unchanged; a label never matches, C18)
  - every other open ask it covers is answered in the same commit (answerCovered)
  rows: recipient unknown · card_always [version_current] → always;
  payment Waiting · card_always [payer == 'agent'] → Queued
end note
opt the same card answered again on the phone
  Phone -> Store : answer {wait, pay once, version v}
  Store --> Phone : refused: "already answered on your computer" (C8, C9)
end

Lane -> Store : start commit re-checks the rule, the approval's freshness\n(at most 1 h old, C10) and the balance; takes the nonce
note right of Lane : then as in seq-03: sign, broadcast stored bytes, follow to Confirmed

== Later: the next payment to Ana ==
Agent -> Tool : wallet~__send {to: "0x9f3c…77a1", amount: "7", token: "USDC"}
Tool -> Store : admission commit: covering finds Always(Mara, wallet, 0x9f3c…)
Store --> Tool : Queued, no card asked (a card still shows the payment)
note right of Store : row: Idle · call [... eff == 'always' and fits] → Queued

== The other answers ==
alt Pay (this once)
  Owner -> Web : Pay
  note right of Web : recipient unknown · card_pay → ask (named, rule Ask); payment Waiting · card_pay → Queued
else Don't pay (this once)
  Owner -> Web : Don't pay
  note right of Web : recipient unknown · card_dont_pay → ask; payment Waiting · card_dont_pay → Refused
else Never pay Ana
  Owner -> Web : Never pay
  note right of Web : recipient · card_never → deny; payment Waiting · card_never [payer == 'agent'] → Refused (see seq-05)
else nobody answers within 24 h (OD-10)
  Store -> Store : the Wait's deadline fires (store timer, not wall clock)
  note right of Store : payment Waiting · deadline → NotPaid: "Not paid: no answer" (C10)
end
@enduml
